{"step_index":271,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T01:04:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-18T10:04:25+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-18T10:04:27+09:00\nThe search for \"\"주식회사 엘씨엠\" \"센텀\" OR \"부산\" 사업자등록번호\" returned the following summary:\n주식회사 엘씨엠의 사업자등록번호는 **755-81-00415**입니다[1][2].\n\n해당 기업은 유통 대기업 내 레고스토어를 운영하는 업체로, 본사는 서울특별시 강서구 마곡동에 위치하고 있습니다[3][1][4]. 부산 지역의 경우 해운대구 센텀시티몰(센텀시티점) 등에 매장을 운영하고 있으나[1][5], 이는 기업의 사업장(지점) 중 하나이며 기업 전체의 사업자등록번호는 위와 동일합니다[1][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [lesprepay.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoCTe0pWl92xk3Yccqf3t4kNJZBIa8BayXQ6PJuwtiM-6T7-tnmj4U2NQQvaK-E9lq_o2D_w36oU1VWXLS0cKAJ95QnivNNAxbRDlsrYOy)\n[2] [lesprepay.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmaV-wXauP3TE3rcYMfKDkRsm87dJZY-og8d9BEFcYtORrfzPYVIff_oWNvgdMehfrxlGBD7treF0Zgv3krVZ04iU_tsANjTt_mvtqBo8bWx4=)\n[3] [albamon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZOisH8v79S1LBHxPraunXSKrUmggyad5i6PKNQFUR2TbO6YxkMiPrIazq4u2k2dKm1PdfFOoxwt-h6Og_BPHlqxDc3dFOBbNjP0iR6vL9ZEH_FEVHZlHDMikjmN5DAkyORxM_g7lNu7wk0pJzHU9F9_yAM3HEAIQRkA==)\n[4] [albamon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZOisH8v79S1LBHxPraunXSKrUmggyad5i6PKNQFUR2TbO6YxkMiPrIazq4u2k2dKm1PdfFOoxwt-h6Og_BPHlqxDc3dFOBbNjP0iR6vL9ZEH_FEVHZlHDMikjmN5DAkyORxM_g7lNu7wk0pJzHU9F9_yAM3HEAIQRkA==)\n[5] [lesprepay.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoCTe0pWl92xk3Yccqf3t4kNJZBIa8BayXQ6PJuwtiM-6T7-tnmj4U2NQQvaK-E9lq_o2D_w36oU1VWXLS0cKAJ95QnivNNAxbRDlsrYOy)"}
