{"step_index":277,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T01:07:59Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-18T10:07:59+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-18T10:08:02+09:00\nThe search for \"\"051-508-8225\" OR (\"또래나라\" \"051\")\" returned the following summary:\n**051-508-8225**는 부산광역시 기장군 정관읍에 위치한 물놀이 용품 제조 전문 기업인 **위니코니(주)**의 전화번호입니다[1][2][3].\n\n**또래나라**는 위니코니(주)의 과거 상호명으로, 1997년에 해당 상호로 변경된 이력이 있습니다[4][5]. 현재도 많은 기업 정보 데이터베이스나 검색 결과에서 위니코니(주)와 '또래나라'가 동일한 업체로 연결되어 확인됩니다[6][7][8].\n\n*   **기업명:** 위니코니(주) (구, 또래나라)[1][4]\n*   **주요 업무:** 유아용 튜브, 구명조끼 등 물놀이 용품 제조 및 판매[1][7]\n*   **웹사이트:** [http://www.airtoy.co.kr](http://www.airtoy.co.kr)[7][5]\n\nSources:\n[1] [airtoy.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGctM-k_QOkpdZ8pb5VNf9UvRYGh1GN0e1tGHUqDO8k3RMLDqXDc7-kQEggWxmu4e48ta1FwNDBm_tU9RwZihRBsa5vsO8Btf3DGYPlCgBz)\n[2] [114.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEy-YT4_4VTl756n8RQGQZmtAO9Fwel9Gaf94ugpmQGQ1jf3UEabg4WP98sTVDqbps7Fnd64PiBgRAxSgnCv49ol5KlF-_ZHptUeeFDXpccJ8KN-gAkrB0bUbH_iTyTVwAumiFLDRi3VlSq0tMa3woFIBsteTKlWtJYc9K3yD7ud_cHt3vIVsKA)\n[3] [airtoy.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGw0Jf7O1nCRcQPCQNn0qGdWqVRu_NmI1nl5Hm7c-a0aVDyq8ovnu5tZdGXCQH70E_JvsB9GkLnSRR2Nnoie1fe-51o5uU5vu9njvq4lqJqHGjKpoz8Gd4m)\n[4] [airtoy.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHyV9zNf2mbJ8t5bMTl9VqqsKMIWvTf9JaKGEN4nRDp66Tn_n5Ps1nQ7b3bcXe29d_iQLAzl15owypyBktciK8DS93iR_ffDBldfynK3ghOD5sZg82pXLzop6E=)\n[5] [danbis.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHikDJorGjCk4FkI4ghGbGc0ImtyaooNl1J1T2vdHpD0SvUZN3W8ABipLVAMKQ2jaWJO22nBVRHrsAOOE0nVn5tnY-nuCiHG9Ny10Sf)\n[6] [38.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4yH1T_H7mxeaNsBrmYgTDuV-bqTP1Rk6NdDYmyQtXjkvFOqk-5WIxN0qWB3JQOMRhWDtMcDs1Jb05MD4evGFLhQiMHJaKEBZU93lUwpOrrUxGz3irzKplkxBwxrX6UFFvoeOMnbOSSFGIReE=)